-- expect-refusal: function dst_v: key (k) has two values in the book main: (1) and (2)
-- a table that carries itself to the next tick and is given another value there: the promise is judged at the tick the second arrives, not only at the first
edb(dst_v).
edb(dst_go).
function dst_v(K, to V).
dst_v(k, 1).
dst_v(K, V)@next :- dst_v(K, V).
dst_go(x).
dst_v(k, 2)@next :- dst_go(x).
